WEBVTT

00:20:58.553 --> 00:21:00.794
Technically -- I'm not
saying I would do this --

00:21:00.818 --> 00:21:03.156
but you could have
the looping version of yourself

00:21:03.180 --> 00:21:04.712
just on the call the whole time.

00:21:04.736 --> 00:21:06.361
This video one, it actually is me,

00:21:06.385 --> 00:21:09.303
so it's sort of like a
"Westworld"-type version of it.

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.876
AG: If we were robots,
it would be easy to be resilient.

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:15.653
Just turn your emotions off
until this crisis is over.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.736
Since we can't do that,

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.808
the next best thing is
to learn from someone

00:21:19.832 --> 00:21:23.986
who's done more remote work
than almost anyone in human history.

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.404
After the break.

00:21:26.443 --> 00:21:28.443
(Music)